# --- Prototype and specification material ------------------------------------
# The design mock-up and the original functional brief. They shaped the project
# but nothing in it reads them: every token, screen and rule that mattered was
# copied into Docs/. Kept locally, out of the repository.
#
# The two prompt patterns cover the briefs written for one piece of work at a
# time, whichever end of the name the word sits at. Those are notes to a reader,
# not to the program, and they are the one place in this tree written in Polish;
# what they establish belongs in the commit message or in Docs/, where it can be
# found without them.
Gentoo portage UI prototype.zip
# Same again: an export of the site, which lives on the Web branch as files.
Web/
prompt-*.md
*-prompt.md
*.dc.html

